      "writtenOn": "2020-09-03T22:11:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just curious if the construct of\n\nswitch(board_version) {\n    case 0: ...\n            break;\n    ...\n    default: ...\n             break;\n}\n\ncan be used as well (which may be better optimized)? Thanks.",
